0,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
1,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
2,1,,status,Ryuji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Yumi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,"Hello everyone. To ensure we allocate these spaces fairly and sustainably, we need a logical basis for our decision. I believe we should start by examining the objective data and past precedents.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,I'm so happy to be working with you all! Let's make sure we find a way that makes everyone smile. I want us to be fair and kind so that everyone feels welcome!,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,"We should be practical. Before we suggest any solutions, we need to understand the actual usage patterns and the physical constraints of the parking area. Let's look at the data first to avoid making an emotional decision.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Let's be realistic: ""making everyone smile"" is a fantasy. We need a system that doesn't make us hate each other. I'm interested in the actual costs and the fallout when people are left without a spot.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with the need for a logical approach. Before we commit to a system, we must understand the administrative burden and the actual effort required to maintain it. Let's examine the facts first.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Asuka,,"I will look into the ""Five years of association minutes"" and ""Last year's complaint log entries."" It is essential to understand previous conflicts and how they were resolved to avoid repeating the same mistakes.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'll check the ""Sticker register and the daily riders"" and ""Morning departures watched from the entrance""! I want to see who's actually using the bikes and how they start their day!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"I'll examine the ""Morning departures watched from the entrance"" and ""Rain exposure along the parking rows."" I want to understand the physical flow of traffic and the actual condition of the spaces to assess the current chaos.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll look into the ""Building account's two-year ledger"" and the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections."" It's about time someone actually checked the money instead of just guessing.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I will examine the ""Treasurer's handover file on cash collections"" and the ""Account from the neighbouring block's secretary."" I want to determine the actual paperwork and labor involved in managing these allocations over time.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"@Yumi, @Ryuji, it is interesting that you are both focusing on the morning flow. I hope that data, combined with the history of complaints I am researching, will reveal the root causes of the current friction.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"@Asuka, I just want to make sure we're being helpful to everyone! If we know how people leave in the morning, maybe we can make things easier and more cheerful for them!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"@Yumi, cheerfulness is secondary to functionality. If the physical layout is causing congestion or damage to the bicycles, no amount of kindness will solve the problem. We need to identify the specific points of friction first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, you're obsessed with ""friction,"" but the real friction usually starts when the bill arrives. Let's see if the numbers actually support your functional utopia or if we're just rearranging deck chairs.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"@Shunichi, the numbers are only one part of the equation. Even a balanced budget is useless if the administrative workload is so heavy that the system collapses. We must consider the human cost of maintenance.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"I agree that administrative burden and financial transparency are important. However, we must not overlook the social stability of the building. I will focus on the historical data to ensure our final decision doesn't inadvertently damage our community.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so glad we're all thinking about different things! It's like a big team effort! I'll do my best to find out who's using the spots so we can all be happy together! See you soon!,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will focus on the physical realities of the parking area. Understanding the traffic flow and environmental exposure is the only way to create a sustainable system. I'll see you all in the next round.,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'll be the one to bring us back to earth with some actual figures. Let's see if the ledger reveals any secrets that your ""social stability"" and ""traffic flow"" have been ignoring. See you all soon.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will focus on the operational side. By analyzing the handover files and the neighboring block's experience, I intend to ensure that whatever system we implement is actually sustainable for the person managing it. See you all soon.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
